{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-139","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-tourn-139"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-talk-403817220-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-139","missionId":"event-tourn-139","mission":"부패한 거래","scene":"부패한 거래","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"타나토스의 저승의 강은 고대 전장을 수장했다. 당신은 계단 가장자리에 서서 파도에 흔들리는 수초를 내려다봤다. 한동안은 그것들이 살아 있는 생명인지, 초목의 망령인지 구분할 수 없었다","talkId":403817220,"textHash":"9914066402908251817","source":"tournHandBookEvent:139/talk-403817220","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a3fb78f8a3fa1038","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-talk-403817221-line"],"bwikiPage":"腐败交易","bwikiRevision":60536,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17918","bwikiMission":"부패한 거래"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-talk-403817221-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-139","missionId":"event-tourn-139","mission":"부패한 거래","scene":"부패한 거래","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"등이 굽은 한 노인이 물을 건너 당신 앞으로 왔다. 노인은 고개를 갸웃대며 당신을 바라보다 한참 후에야 입을 열었다","talkId":403817221,"textHash":"6084505717068193144","source":"tournHandBookEvent:139/talk-403817221","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a3fb78f8a3fa1038","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-talk-403817222-line"],"bwikiPage":"腐败交易","bwikiRevision":60536,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17918","bwikiMission":"부패한 거래"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-talk-403817222-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-139","missionId":"event-tourn-139","mission":"부패한 거래","scene":"부패한 거래","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「친구, 혹시 금화 몇 개 줄 수 있겠나? 타나토스의 배를 타게만 해준다면 무엇이든 주겠네!」 노인이 당신의 팔뚝을 움켜잡자 뼈가 시릴 정도의 혹한에 털이 쭈뼛 섰다","talkId":403817222,"textHash":"9660133277576552099","source":"tournHandBookEvent:139/talk-403817222","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a3fb78f8a3fa1038","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"腐败交易","bwikiRevision":60536,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17918","bwikiMission":"부패한 거래"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-text-3760681733198842516-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-139","missionId":"event-tourn-139","mission":"부패한 거래","scene":"부패한 거래","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"더 얹어서 좌석을 업그레이드해 준다","talkId":null,"textHash":"3760681733198842516","source":"tournHandBookEvent:139/text-3760681733198842516","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"453ace5450fe0c2c","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"腐败交易","bwikiRevision":60536,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17918","bwikiMission":"부패한 거래"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-text-8504485485723670482-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-139","missionId":"event-tourn-139","mission":"부패한 거래","scene":"부패한 거래","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"단순한 성의 표시를 한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"8504485485723670482","source":"tournHandBookEvent:139/text-8504485485723670482","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"67b86e066860a1c6","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"腐败交易","bwikiRevision":60536,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17918","bwikiMission":"부패한 거래"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-text-11758976937259342755-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-139","missionId":"event-tourn-139","mission":"부패한 거래","scene":"부패한 거래","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"당신은 늘 노인과 아이를 소중히 여겨왔다","talkId":null,"textHash":"11758976937259342755","source":"tournHandBookEvent:139/text-11758976937259342755","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"76ed95fbc2039085","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"腐败交易","bwikiRevision":60536,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17918","bwikiMission":"부패한 거래"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-text-1405153403488344